      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm a bit confused. I was looking for a more technical breakdown of the biochemistry here. Can you ignore the analogies for a second and just explain the actual relationship between the enzyme activity in the rye and the pH drop? I need to know the specific mechanism of how that protein content is affecting the lactic acid production.",
